Comment:
 Packaged for SkillFishOS from our fork, github.com/MTSistemi/bc250-encoding-decoding-fix,
 which carries nine fixes offered back upstream as pull requests 21 and 22:
 the 16-bit shader features the shaders declare but nobody enabled, the buffers
 the motion-estimation path never allocated, the rate control that was built and
 switched off, a DC intra prediction that no decoder could reproduce, and the
 work that took HEVC from 31 to 113 frames per second.

